data/
results/*
# Rendered manuscript figures are versioned: they are the deliverable, and a
# figure nobody can find in the repository is a figure that has to be rebuilt
# from raw data to be looked at.  Everything else under results/ is derived
# intermediates and stays out.
!results/figures/
results/figures/*
!results/figures/*.pdf
!results/figures/*.png
!results/figures/source_data/
!results/hypomap/
*.h5ad
*.h5
*.zarr/
*.ome.tif
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
